# Hungarian counting-toward-the-hour clock: "haromnegyed <H>" == three
# quarters of the way toward hour H, i.e. (H-1):45 -- "haromnegyed kilenc"
# == 08:45.  Citation: Rounds, Carol H. "Hungarian: An Essential Grammar",
# 2nd ed., Routledge 2009, sec. on telling the time; Wiktionary
# "haromnegyed" (Hungarian), sense "three quarters toward the named hour".
háromnegyed
